<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Passkey Setup - Track Credentials</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="form-container">
            <h1>Set Up Your Passkey</h1>
            <p>Welcome, <strong>{{ username }}</strong>!</p>
            <p>Enhance your account security by setting up a passkey. This allows you to sign in using biometric authentication or a security key.</p>
            
            <div class="passkey-info">
                <h3>What is a passkey?</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>More secure than passwords</li>
                    <li>Uses biometric authentication (fingerprint, face recognition)</li>
                    <li>No need to remember complex passwords</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <form method="post" action="/passkey-setup">
                <input type="hidden" name="username" value="{{ username }}">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Complete Setup</button>
                <p class="skip-note">For now, click Complete Setup to continue to your dashboard.</p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
